abstract: >-
  Pipeline for testing whether spread-based uncertainty between universal
  machine-learning interatomic potentials detects their shared underestimation
  of potential-energy surface curvature (phonon softening). Work in progress,
  no results reported yet.
keywords:
  - machine-learning interatomic potentials
  - uncertainty quantification
  - phonons
